     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem qc-ethnicity</b></p><a name=\"qc-ethnicity\"> </a><a name=\"hcqc-ethnicity\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir.cqdg.ca/CodeSystem/qc-ethnicity</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td><td><b>French (fr)</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">French Canadian<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-FrenchCanadian\"> </a></td><td>Descendants of the First Nations of the St. Lawrence Valley</td><td>Canadien Francais</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">English Canadian<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-EnglishCanadian\"> </a></td><td>Descendants of the First Nations of the St. Lawrence Valley</td><td>Canadien Anglais</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">First Nation, Inuit, Metis<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-FirstNation.44Inuit.44Metis\"> </a></td><td>Person who are descendants of the natives or the indigenous peoples of the Americas</td><td>Premières Nations, Métis et Inuits du Canada</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">European<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-European\"> </a></td><td>Anyone from or whose ancestors originate from the European continent (excluding French Canadians).</td><td>Caucasien Européen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Arab<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-Arab\"> </a></td><td/><td>Arabe</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Latin American<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-LatinAmerican\"> </a></td><td>Canadian or Quebecois who are descendants of people from Latin America</td><td>Hispanique</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">African or Caribbean<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-AfricanorCaribbean\"> </a></td><td>Person belonging to ethnic group with total or partial ancestry from any of the black racial groups of Africa.</td><td>Africain ou caribéen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">East and Southeast Asian<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-EastandSoutheastAsian\"> </a></td><td>Canadian or Quebecois who are descendants of people from east and southeast asia</td><td>Asiatique de l'est et du sud-est</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">South Asian<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-SouthAsian\"> </a></td><td>Canadian or Quebecois who are descendants of people from south asia</td><td>Asiatique du sud</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Mixted<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-Mixted\"> </a></td><td>Individual descending from more than one ethnic group</td><td>Mixte</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Other<a name=\"qc-ethnicity-Other\"> </a></td><td>Other ethnicity</td><td>Autre</td></tr></table></div>"
